# Hub API (docs/api.md) against the dev server, for the VS Code REST Client extension
# (humao.rest-client): click "Send Request" above a request. Run `pnpm dev --port 3100` first.
# The secret is the seeded dev hub's (supabase/seed.sql), not a real one.

@base = http://localhost:3100
@hub = Bearer dev-hub-secret

### Lift the garment off hanger 3 (opens an absence: "away")
POST {{base}}/api/hub/events
Authorization: {{hub}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "events": [{ "hanger": 3, "on_rail": true, "garment_on": false }] }

### Hang it back right away (closes it as "browsed", no wear)
POST {{base}}/api/hub/events
Authorization: {{hub}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "events": [{ "hanger": 3, "on_rail": true, "garment_on": true }] }

### Away 15 s, then back, in one call (the demo closet counts it as "worn")
POST {{base}}/api/hub/events
Authorization: {{hub}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    { "hanger": 4, "on_rail": true, "garment_on": false, "age_ms": 15000 },
    { "hanger": 4, "on_rail": true, "garment_on": true }
  ]
}

### Duplicate seq: send twice, the second answers duplicates: 1
POST {{base}}/api/hub/events
Authorization: {{hub}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "events": [{ "hanger": 2, "on_rail": true, "garment_on": true, "seq": 42 }] }

### Poll for light commands, as the hub does every second (also runs the sweep)
# @name poll
GET {{base}}/api/hub/commands
Authorization: {{hub}}

### Ack the first command the poll returned (send "poll" first)
POST {{base}}/api/hub/commands/ack
Authorization: {{hub}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [{{poll.response.body.$.commands[0].id}}] }

### Wrong secret: 401
GET {{base}}/api/hub/commands
Authorization: Bearer not-the-secret

### Bad body: 400 with the Zod issues
POST {{base}}/api/hub/events
Authorization: {{hub}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "events": [] }


# ---- Dev only (/api/sim/*): the server adds the secret, 404 in production ----

### Blink hanger 5 white (Find it); poll above to receive it
POST {{base}}/api/sim/lights
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hangers": [5], "light": { "color": "white", "pattern": "blink2" } }

### Hanger 18 amber, breathing (lasting until the next lasting light)
POST {{base}}/api/sim/lights
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hangers": [18], "light": { "color": "amber", "pattern": "breathe" } }

### Every hanger back in the closet, lights off, open absences and pending commands dropped
POST {{base}}/api/sim/reset
